{"id": "EUVD-2026-76454", "enisaUuid": "026f2eae-238f-3737-824b-0dd6090f4bc5", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsunrpc: fix use-after-free in __rpc_clnt_handle_event and __rpc_clnt_remove_pipedir\n\nNormal client creation goes through rpc_setup_pipedir(), which records\nclnt->pipefs_sb, but the mount-event path in __rpc_clnt_handle_event()\ncalls rpc_setup_pipedir_sb() directly and never refreshes that field.\nThe umount path also removes the directory without clearing\nclnt->pipefs_sb.\n\nAfter a late pipefs mount or any remount, rpc_clnt_remove_pipedir()\ncompares the current superblock against a stale pipefs_sb pointer and\nskips cleanup, leaving pipefs dentries whose inode private data still\npoints at a freed rpc_clnt, leading to a potential use-after-free during\nsubsequent rpc_info_open() or rpc_show_info() calls.\n\nFix this by properly updating clnt->pipefs_sb upon mount events and\nclearing it during unmount or failure paths.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:44:19", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:47:48", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f99fedfd1dbffe8d20b421c9a7d4655a135d4fcd", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/59527bbfb1eabdb28e95e7c725886cc2c2899cb3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e769fcde3cc73e847b1eb3acd40c04a291cb0c0c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cdf7a233cb94774b0e7df42d9157077983f5022c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/932a8cf6abb2b2f8677b79153a823108d8861fe2"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89543", "GHSA-892h-jc8g-4jrg"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "017b94f6-4b8f-3951-8c99-cd0c6cf8986b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1cdb52ffd6600a37bd355d8dce58ecd03e55e618"}, {"id": "04108580-364e-38ee-8fd3-fa7a719943de", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.111"}, {"id": "07354d5a-c617-3b0e-8dd1-f61d733c175e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "bfca5fb4e97c46503ddfc582335917b0cc228264 <cdf7a233cb94774b0e7df42d9157077983f5022c"}, {"id": "07dab51d-b8bf-30a0-ae40-0228ce64e783", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "bfca5fb4e97c46503ddfc582335917b0cc228264 <e769fcde3cc73e847b1eb3acd40c04a291cb0c0c"}, {"id": "15551d76-f1eb-31e0-a9df-abd79d5689b9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.1.64 <6.2"}, {"id": "376aefb3-7aa1-36ba-9ee9-a48e7598412c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7d61d1da2ed1f682c41cae0c8d4719cdaccee5c5"}, {"id": "504156d6-a337-3836-b99f-cc57c5a2a887", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.7"}, {"id": "558e859f-8db0-3c26-8847-3b8bfbdc1acc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "194454afa6aa9d6ed74f0c57127bc8beb27c20df"}, {"id": "5d0a6541-4c7d-30b6-b4d4-fd94350a1716", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "17866066b8ac1cc38fb449670bc15dc9fee4b40a"}, {"id": "5f6325a2-3215-3eb6-bea0-3ed205d425ff", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "bfca5fb4e97c46503ddfc582335917b0cc228264 <59527bbfb1eabdb28e95e7c725886cc2c2899cb3"}, {"id": "669e3bc6-9ba2-34c1-9b63-5129e48209e7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dedf2a0eb9448ae73b270743e6ea9b108189df46"}, {"id": "7034d271-4e01-31dc-b8f5-93e396f63605", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7749fd2dbef72a52b5c9ffdbf877691950ed4680"}, {"id": "71f2e5f1-9065-356e-9f7c-9f3c509abe9b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "835cacf5-5724-3a3d-a385-57fadde67c26", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "bfca5fb4e97c46503ddfc582335917b0cc228264 <932a8cf